  <div class="post-body">
    <p>I'm Fabio Gabelli, founder of Ticketto. For over ten years I've worked at the intersection of software and events: I started out building digital tools for organizers and trainers, and over time I watched the same frustrations repeat dozens of times — queues at check-in, QR scanners that won't turn on, fees that eat the margin, attendees who can't find their ticket email.</p>

    <p>I founded Ticketto to solve exactly these problems with a different approach: instead of selling dedicated hardware, we turn your staff's smartphone into a professional QR scanner. Instead of opaque fees, flat transparent pricing. Instead of a complex tool, a flow that lets you create an event in five minutes.</p>

    <h2>What I write here</h2>
    <p>On this blog I publish <strong>hands-on guides based on what we see every day working with hundreds of organizers</strong>: what works, what breaks the night, which mistakes cost you dearly. No generic theory — just practice and numbers.</p>

    <h2>Areas of expertise</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Event management and online ticketing</li>
      <li>Digital check-in and access control</li>
      <li>Payments, GDPR and data privacy</li>
      <li>Marketing and conversion optimization for registrations</li>
      <li>SaaS, online payments and Stripe integrations</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>You can reach me at <a href="mailto:fabio@ticketto.it">fabio@ticketto.it</a> or on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/fabio-gabelli-10bb35b1/" rel="me">LinkedIn</a>.</p>
